{
  "total_segments": 28,
  "speaker": "zh_male_liufei_uranus_bigtts",
  "total_duration_seconds": 98.88,
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "shot": 1,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "file": "voiceover-01.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 30957,
      "text": "你花钱调的GPT-5.5，可能根本不是GPT-5.5。",
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.86
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "shot": 2,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "file": "voiceover-02.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 24429,
      "text": "很多国内开发者都在用AI中转站。",
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "start": 3.86,
      "end": 6.91
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "shot": 2,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "file": "voiceover-03.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 24429,
      "text": "便宜、方便、支付宝直付。",
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "start": 6.91,
      "end": 9.96
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "shot": 2,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "file": "voiceover-04.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 50157,
      "text": "但你有没有想过，你付的GPT-5.5的钱，背后跑的到底是什么模型？",
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "start": 9.96,
      "end": 16.22
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "shot": 3,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "file": "voiceover-05.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 32301,
      "text": "德国CISPA是欧洲顶级的网络安全机构。",
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "start": 16.22,
      "end": 20.26
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "shot": 3,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "file": "voiceover-06.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 67629,
      "text": "他们审计了17家中转站，用模型指纹技术逐一检测，结果45%的模型身份验证失败。",
      "duration_seconds": 8.45,
      "start": 20.26,
      "end": 28.7
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "shot": 3,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "file": "voiceover-07.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 18093,
      "text": "将近一半，都是假的。",
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "start": 28.7,
      "end": 30.96
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "file": "voiceover-08.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 19437,
      "text": "三种套路：直接掉包，",
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "start": 30.96,
      "end": 33.38
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "file": "voiceover-09.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 24621,
      "text": "用便宜模型冒充贵的赚差价；",
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "start": 33.38,
      "end": 36.46
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "file": "voiceover-10.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 9837,
      "text": "随机路由，",
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "start": 36.46,
      "end": 37.68
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 4,
      "file": "voiceover-11.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 22701,
      "text": "每次分配不同模型让你无法察觉；",
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "start": 37.68,
      "end": 40.51
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 5,
      "file": "voiceover-12.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 10029,
      "text": "降级版本，",
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "start": 40.51,
      "end": 41.76
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "shot": 4,
      "sub_index": 6,
      "file": "voiceover-13.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 26157,
      "text": "用旧模型冒充新版。",
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "start": 41.76,
      "end": 45.02
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "shot": 5,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "file": "voiceover-14.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 38637,
      "text": "你以为AI在帮你写高质量代码，实际拿到的可能是入门级回答。",
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "start": 45.02,
      "end": 49.85
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "shot": 5,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "file": "voiceover-15.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 30957,
      "text": "推理能力暴跌40%，这意味着什么？",
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "start": 49.85,
      "end": 53.71
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "shot": 5,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "file": "voiceover-16.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 25773,
      "text": "你让AI写的代码，逻辑可能全是错的。",
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "start": 53.71,
      "end": 56.93
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "shot": 6,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "file": "voiceover-17.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 54765,
      "text": "除了模型造假，还有更大的坑：你的所有提示词和AI回复，中转站全都能看到。",
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "start": 56.93,
      "end": 63.77
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "shot": 6,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "file": "voiceover-18.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 35565,
      "text": "88%没有营业执照，只有1家有ICP备案。",
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "start": 63.77,
      "end": 68.21
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "shot": 6,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "file": "voiceover-19.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 30957,
      "text": "去年WildCard停服，30万用户突然没法用了。",
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "start": 68.21,
      "end": 72.07
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "shot": 7,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "file": "voiceover-20.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 14829,
      "text": "怎么判断有没有被坑？",
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "start": 72.07,
      "end": 73.92
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "shot": 7,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "file": "voiceover-21.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 54573,
      "text": "推荐用LLMmap工具，发射24个探针查询就能验证模型真伪。",
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "start": 73.92,
      "end": 80.74
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "shot": 7,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "file": "voiceover-22.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 37293,
      "text": "还有个简单方法：问模型一些特征问题，套壳模型很容易露馅。",
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "start": 80.74,
      "end": 85.39
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "shot": 8,
      "sub_index": 1,
      "file": "voiceover-23.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 25965,
      "text": "三条建议：敏感业务走官方API；",
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "start": 85.39,
      "end": 88.63
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "shot": 8,
      "sub_index": 2,
      "file": "voiceover-24.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 11757,
      "text": "必须用中转的，",
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "start": 88.63,
      "end": 90.1
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "shot": 8,
      "sub_index": 3,
      "file": "voiceover-25.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 29037,
      "text": "接上LLMmap做检测；",
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "start": 90.1,
      "end": 93.72
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "shot": 8,
      "sub_index": 4,
      "file": "voiceover-26.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 10029,
      "text": "充值别太多，",
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "start": 93.72,
      "end": 94.97
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "shot": 8,
      "sub_index": 5,
      "file": "voiceover-27.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 10029,
      "text": "防范跑路。",
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "start": 94.97,
      "end": 96.22
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "shot": 8,
      "sub_index": 6,
      "file": "voiceover-28.mp3",
      "size_bytes": 21357,
      "text": "关注我，避开AI开发路上的坑。",
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "start": 96.22,
      "end": 98.88
    }
  ]
}